  "id": "BIT-gitea-2026-96399",
  "summary": "Gitea denial of service through external issue tracker patterns",
  "details": "A repository's external issue tracker regular expression containing alternating capture groups could produce invalid slice indexes when Gitea rendered issue references, causing a runtime panic that terminated the Gitea process. A user who can edit a repository's external issue tracker settings could make any later rendering of matching content, such as viewing a README, crash the instance for all users.",
